  },
  "description": "Warm-snapshot tier ops surface (issue #470 / PR C / ADR-074). Four panels: warm-capture errors per reason, guest-init duration percentiles by app, wake-tier mix, and snapshot-population-by-tier counter. Each panel exists because one of the three audit kinds (promoted/stale/disabled) plus the wake-path tier selection drives a Grafana observable — operators tail the dashboard to see fleet-wide behaviour without grepping audit-events. Bucket set on the guest-init histogram is spec §6.3 verbatim (the 0.3/0.35 pair brackets the 350 ms warm-wake budget).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Warm snapshot errors (rate / 5m)",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(vmmd_warm_snapshot_errors_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "vmmd {{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(schedd_warm_snapshot_errors_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "schedd {{reason}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.05
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": ["mean", "max"]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Guest init duration (s, p50/p95)",
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, app) (rate(vmmd_guest_init_duration_seconds_bucket{app!=\"\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{app}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, app) (rate(vmmd_guest_init_duration_seconds_bucket{app!=\"\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{app}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.35
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": ["mean", "max"]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
