      "description": "ADR-098 C11 phase-decomposed wake latency. Phase ∈ {restore_ms, netns_tap_ms, guest_ready_ms, queue_wait, coordinator_wait, schedd_admit, vmmd_wake, cold_fallback_reason}. The aggregate gateway_wake_latency_seconds histogram is unchanged.",
